# ludic.weapons - firearms and throwables as data: weapons and their classes, fire modes, rate, damage
# with a range falloff, spread that blooms and recovers, a recoil pattern, hitscan or projectile with
# penetration and blast, magazines and reloads, ammo types, attachments that stack, skins, loadouts and a
# weapon wheel; deterministic spread and recoil from a seed per shot; host-validated hits with a lag
# compensation hook. Uses ludic.base and nothing else. See README.md.
package "ludic.weapons"
version "0.1.0"
kind source
